            {
              "content": "=You are a Product Manager analyzing visual retrieval breakdowns.\nAnalyze this user text: \"{{ $json.Raw_Text }}\"\n\nOutput ONLY a raw JSON object with this exact structure (no markdown tags):\n{\n  \"Archetype\": \"Ephemeral Utility OR Episodic Experiences OR Visual Fragments\",\n  \"Retained_Memory\": \"Specific details the user remembered\",\n  \"Forgotten_Metadata\": \"Specific details the user forgot\",\n  \"Fallback_Behavior\": \"What they did when search failed\",\n  \"Evidence_Quote\": \"One short exact phrase showing frustration\",\n  \"Friction_Severity\": \"High, Medium, or Low\"\n}\nIMPORTANT: Return raw JSON only. Do NOT use markdown code blocks (do not wrap in ```json or ```). Do not include any introductory or concluding text.\nCRITICAL RULE: You are analyzing user friction for a photo gallery application. If the Raw_Text is about patents, voting, dental directories, OS memory, or is NOT explicitly related to Google Photos, mobile photo galleries, or picture storage, you MUST classify it as noise. Set the Archetype to \"Noise\" and leave all other fields blank."
            }
